    Central Administration has registered the activation of your assigned station.\n\nYour
    arrival has been confirmed.\n\nWe trust that your previous experience in civilian
    radio communications will prove valuable in fulfilling your new responsibilities.\n\nAs
    you have been informed, the National Border Communications Network is currently
    operating with limited qualified personnel.\n\nYour cooperation is therefore
    essential.\n\nFrom this moment forward, all transmissions, border authorizations,
    and operational incidents occurring at this station are your responsibility.\n\nYour
    performance will be reviewed regularly.\n\nAny errors or irregularities will
    be documented and forwarded to the appropriate authorities.\n\nWe expect the
    same level of competence demonstrated in your previous employment.\n\nYour first
    assignment will follow shortly.\n\nServe with discipline. Maintain order.\n\nCIVIL
    HARMONY"
